<title>NEW ZEALAND: WestpacTrust lowers NZ mortgage rate to 9.95 pct.</title>
<headline>WestpacTrust lowers NZ mortgage rate to 9.95 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>WestpacTrust said on Tuesday it was cutting its New Zealand floating mortage rate by 0.8 percentage points to 9.95 percent effective immediately for new borrowers and from January 28 for existing borrowers.</p>
</text>
